+
+### Keyword source values
+
+Keyword-dependent Sigma rules use a private `_sigma_fulltext` TEXT column in
+`logs`. The streaming processor builds it from decoded scalar values before
+flattening or generated metadata, including values that later mappings or
+exclusions hide. `ProcessingContext` enables capture before ingestion whenever
+its loaded rules or correlation dependencies require it, including unified and
+per-file runs and their workers. The provenance table `_zircolite_fulltext`
+records `logs`, `_sigma_fulltext`, and `source-values-v1` and travels with saved
+databases. The core validates provenance and non-NULL TEXT coverage before
+running a dependent rule or plan, caching successful checks per content
+revision. Insertion, reset and database load invalidate that cache. Old
+version-2 rules and plans run without the private column.
